# ======================================================================
# hls-exercises — .gitignore
#
# Rule of thumb: if `make clean` deletes it, git ignores it.
# Hand-written sources and everything in notes/ are tracked.
# ======================================================================

# --- Vitis HLS projects -----------------------------------------------
# The default project name from run_hls.tcl, plus the one-off probe
# projects. Anything matching *_proj is regenerated by the tool.
hls_proj/
*_proj/
*log

# Occasionally a project is opened without -reset and leaves these
# alongside rather than inside the project directory.
*.aps
*.directive
.autopilot/

# --- Vitis / Vivado strays in the working directory -------------------
vitis_hls.log
vivado_hls.log
vivado.log
run.log
*.jou
*.str
*.pb
.Xil/
.ipcache/
.crash_reporter/
.crash_report.log
hs_err_pid*.log

# --- Simulation (appears from S0.2 onward) ----------------------------
xsim.dir/
*.wdb
*.wcfg
webtalk*.jou
webtalk*.log
xelab.pb
xsim*.log

# --- Implementation (appears at S6.2) ---------------------------------
# export_design -flow impl output lives inside the project, but Vivado
# can also drop these at the invocation point.
*.xpr
*.runs/
*.gen/
*.cache/
*.hw/
*.sim/

# --- Python tooling (sweep.py / collect.py / plot.py, added at S6.2) --
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Generated figures ------------------------------------------------
# Plots are reproducible from results.csv, so they are not tracked.
# Delete these two lines if you would rather version the figures that
# go into a writeup.
notes/figures/
*.pdf
*.png

# --- Editor / OS ------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store

# ======================================================================
# Explicitly tracked — these override the patterns above.
# notes/ holds the only content in this repo that cannot be
# regenerated, so nothing in it should ever be ignored by accident.
# ======================================================================
!notes/
!notes/results.csv
!notes/findings.md
!notes/env.md
!common/
!**/README.md
!**/*.cpp
!**/*.h
!**/*.hpp
!**/run_hls.tcl
!**/directives.tcl
!**/params.json